  "body": "Found by the review of PR #2457 (merged, commit 0727d7e9b). PR #2457 carried PR #1687. Source: review comment 6977507075.\n\nOwed items:\n\n- `fixture_menu.rs:114` and `theme_drop.rs:121` use different rules for the hover fill of a disabled row. The Theme menu checks `live`. The Fixtures menu does not. Use one rule. Add a test that a disabled row paints no hover fill.\n- `crates/ui/src/egui_app/tests/structural.rs` has 584 lines. `theme.rs` has 447 lines. `panes.rs` has more than 400 lines. Split each file along its domain seam. The `#[test]` count stays the same.\n- The test `dropdown_icon_clearance_derives_from_padding` repeats the formula. Replace it with a pin that measures the drawn result. Or remove the duplication.\n- `panes.rs:1401`: in a window narrower than the longest machine label, the label is cut. The doc comment of `machine_menu_width` says that text is never cut. Correct the comment or the behaviour. The decision file `docs/decisions/2065-theme-dropdown-tokens-uma.md` accepts the cut.\n\nDone means: each item above is done, or has a recorded decision in `docs/decisions/`.\n",
